# 2. UNDERSTAND THE MERIDIAN BUSINESS MODEL

Meridian is a cloud-based, AI-powered B2B Trade Orchestration SaaS platform.

Businesses already know their buyers or sellers when they join Meridian.

They come to Meridian to manage and coordinate their existing international trade transactions.

Meridian is NOT:
- A supplier-discovery platform.
- A customer-discovery platform.
- A lead-generation platform.
- An automatic buyer-seller matching marketplace.

Its purpose is to coordinate trade activities through one centralized SaaS environment.

The future platform will include:
- Business verification.
- Platform subscriptions.
- Platform agreements.
- Buyer–Seller trade agreements.
- Payment coordination.
- Shipment monitoring.
- AI-based risk detection.
- Dispute support.
- Settlement reporting.

Phase 2 must establish the companies, secure accounts, agreement records and Buyer–Seller connection process required by these later modules.

